cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or these derived results, please cite both the software and the paper listed below."
title: "protocol-audit: a protocol-sensitivity audit toolkit for binder-design leaderboards"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit that audits how much a de novo binder-design leaderboard depends on the
  evaluation protocol rather than on the designs, together with the derived per-panel
  results, bootstrap tensors and figure sources for the accompanying manuscript.
